%% ============ 图1：系统体检主线（点击开始体检 → 后端执行命令 → 前端渲染状态） ============
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as DiagnosticsPage (React)
    participant Bus as ApiBus (bus.ts)
    participant API as Express DiagnosticRouter
    participant Svc as DiagnosticService
    participant Eng as DiagnosticsEngine (engine.ts)

    User->>FE: 选择资产，点击「开始体检」
    FE->>Bus: diagnostics.run(assetId)
    Bus->>API: POST /api/diagnostics/run {assetId}
    API->>Svc: run(assetId?)
    Svc->>Eng: diagnose()
    Eng-->>Svc: DiagnoseResult（只读 exec 标准命令）
    Svc-->>API: DiagnoseResult
    API-->>Bus: 200 {code:0, data, message}
    Bus-->>FE: DiagnoseResult
    FE->>FE: 渲染 MetricCard（✅⚠️❌ 状态映射）
    FE-->>User: 结构化诊断报告 + 建议 + 导出按钮

%% ============ 图2：态势巡检仪表盘聚合 ============
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as DashboardPage
    participant Bus as ApiBus
    participant API as Express DashboardRouter
    participant DSvc as DashboardService
    participant Store as MemoryStore

    User->>FE: 打开仪表盘
    FE->>Bus: dashboard.summary()
    Bus->>API: GET /api/dashboard
    API->>DSvc: summarize()
    DSvc->>Store: getAssets() / getAlerts() / getPatrols()
    Store-->>DSvc: 数据集合
    DSvc-->>API: DashboardSummary（健康分布/告警/巡检）
    API-->>Bus: 200 {code:0, data}
    Bus-->>FE: DashboardSummary
    FE->>FE: KPI卡 + 健康分布环 + 最近告警流 + 资产榜

%% ============ 图3：知识检索 + 关联视图 ============
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as KnowledgePage / RelationPage
    participant Bus as ApiBus
    participant API as Express Knowledge/Relation Router
    participant KSvc as KnowledgeService
    participant KB as KnowledgeBase (knowledge.mjs)

    User->>FE: 输入现象「磁盘满」
    FE->>Bus: knowledge.search("磁盘满")
    Bus->>API: GET /api/knowledge/search?q=磁盘满
    API->>KSvc: search(q)
    KSvc->>KB: searchKnowledge(q)
    KB-->>KSvc: FAQ 命中
    KSvc-->>API: KnowledgeHit[]
    API-->>Bus: 200 {code:0, data}
    Bus-->>FE: KnowledgeHit[]（标题/正文/来源）
    User->>FE: 点击某资产查看「相关资料和相关项目」
    FE->>Bus: relations.of(asset)
    Bus->>API: GET /api/relations/:asset
    API->>KSvc: related(asset)
    KSvc->>KB: relatedProjects(asset)
    KB-->>KSvc: RelatedProject[]
    KSvc-->>API: RelatedProject[]
    API-->>Bus: 200 {code:0, data}
    Bus-->>FE: 关联三栏（项目/工单/知识）渲染
